---
import Window from "../ui/Window.astro";
---

<section id="about">
    <Window title="about.txt">
        <p>
            I like owning a feature end to end: design, code, deployment and
            monitoring. I have worked mostly in TypeScript but I'm comfortable
            adapting to different languages and technologies. I like
            understanding how things work before jumping into implementation,
            exploring different approaches, and finding the right balance
            between simplicity, efficiency, and maintainability. I'm always
            looking for ways to improve things, even when they already work.
        </p>

        <p>
            At PixBet I led the backend and cloud infrastructure for an iGaming
            platform from conception to production. In 2025 I joined Devoteam to
            work on a Critical TechWorks project, developing in-vehicle software
            for BMW and Rolls-Royce.
        </p>

        <p>
            I'm curious by nature, which extends well beyond software. I enjoy
            tinkering with computers and contributing to open source, but I also
            like getting away from a screen to work on my car or play bass. I
            love spending time outdoors, whether it's rock climbing or spending
            a day fishing, and I'm always up for trying out new things.
        </p>
    </Window>
</section>

<style>
    section {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    p {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.4rem 1.5rem;
        color: var(--border);

        &:first-child {
            padding-top: 1rem;
        }

        &:last-child {
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
